  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ねどこや　エサを　たべる　ばしょなどようとに　あわせて　いくつも　へやがわかれた　おおきな　すを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "잠을 자는 곳이나 먹이를 먹는 곳 등, 용도에 따라 나눈 여러 개의 방으로 구성된 커다란 집을 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在自己所建的巨大巢穴裡，會有配合睡眠和用餐等用途所分出的多個房間。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils construisent des nids gigantesques divisés en espaces distincts qui répondent à différents besoins, comme dormir ou s’alimenter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie bauen große Nester mit diversen Räumen, die alle unterschiedlichen Zwecken dienen, wie etwa dem Schlafen oder Essen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Construyen grandes nidos que dividen en varias cámaras destinadas a distintas funciones, como dormir o comer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Costruiscono una grande tana divisa in più stanze a seconda dell’uso: una per dormire, una per mangiare e così via.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They build huge nests with many rooms that are used for different purposes, such as eating and sleeping.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "寝床や　エサを　食べる　場所など用途に　合わせて　いくつも　部屋が分かれた　大きな　巣を　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会制造巨大的巢穴，并根据用途来分出多个房间，包含寝室、餐厅等等。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Construyen grandes nidos que dividen en varias cámaras destinadas a distintas funciones, como dormir o comer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつのまにか　こどもが　ふえていた。かぞくのように　くらすが　３びきのかんけいは　かいめいされていない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어느새 아이가 늘었다. 가족같이 지내지만, 세 마리의 관계는 제대로 밝혀진 것이 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不知不覺間多了個小孩。雖然像家族一樣生活，但３隻的關係仍然是個謎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Leur nombre a soudainement augmenté. Ils vivent ensemble comme une famille, mais on ignore la véritable nature de leurs liens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Auf einmal waren sie zu dritt. Obgleich diese Gruppe wie eine Familie zusammenlebt, ist das Verhältnis der drei untereinander unbekannt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una cría apareció de la noche a la mañana. Conviven como si fuesen una familia, aunque se desconocen los lazos que los unen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il più piccolo è comparso dal nulla da un giorno all’altro. Vivono assieme come una famiglia, ma la relazione tra i tre componenti non è chiara.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The little one just appeared one day. They all live together like a family, but the relationship between the three is still unclear.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつの間にか　子どもが　増えていた。家族のように　暮らすが　３匹の関係は　解明されていない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不知不觉之间多了个小孩。虽然像一家子一样生活，但３只的关系仍是个迷。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una cría apareció de la noche a la mañana. Conviven como si fuesen una familia, aunque se desconocen los lazos que los unen.",
      "language": {
